        "id": "firing-deck"
      }
    ],
    "summary": "No. Once a TRANSPORT takes an embarked unit's guns through Firing Deck, any boost those guns get only while their own unit carries them no longer counts. For instance, a Trukk firing the Snazzguns of embarked Flash Gitz, who took Supa-snazz Dakka as an upgrade and have a Big Mek with Targetin' Squigs attached, gains nothing from Finderz Keeperz, from More Dakka on the Big Mek, from Targetin' Squigs or from Supa-snazz Dakka.",
